  data: {
    LLM: '1. 1st Street: Each player gets one card face-down (hole) and one card face-up. Betting round begins with the lowest upcard (Bring-In).\n2. 2nd Street: A second upcard is dealt. Betting round begins with the highest visible hand.\n3. 3rd Street: A third upcard is dealt. Betting round begins with the highest visible hand.\n4. 4th Street: The final upcard is dealt. Final betting round.\n5. Showdown: hole cards are revealed.',
    Player: '1. 1st Street: Each player gets one card face-down (hole) and one card face-up. Betting round begins with the lowest upcard (Bring-In).\n2. 2nd Street: A second upcard is dealt. Betting round begins with the highest visible hand.\n3. 3rd Street: A third upcard is dealt. Betting round begins with the highest visible hand.\n4. 4th Street: The final upcard is dealt. Final betting round.\n5. Showdown: hole cards are revealed.',
